# OPTIONAL: direct-attached USB printing for paper backups.
#
# Rename to printing.list.chroot to enable. Adds roughly 200-250 MB.
#
# Rationale: if you are printing recovery material (BitLocker keys, age
# identity, Shamir shares), it must go from the air-gapped box to a
# directly-attached USB printer. Writing a PDF to a USB stick and printing it
# from a networked machine puts the plaintext on that machine's spool.
cups-daemon
cups-client
cups-filters
printer-driver-gutenprint
printer-driver-hpcups
enscript
ghostscript
